"The player controls a bird character using a single-tap mechanic that applies a brief upward impulse, countering constant gravity. The core gameplay involves navigating through narrow vertical gaps in procedurally generated obstacles that scroll from right to left. The visual style utilizes high-contrast 2D pixel art with smooth parallax-scrolling backgrounds. The game ends instantly upon collision with any obstacle or the ground. The win condition is score-based, challenging players to pass through as many pipe sets as possible to achieve a new high score in a single, continuous run."